OL,3,GNEWSACouncil with no leader faces
OL,4,Agovernment takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment commissioners could be
OL,7,Fbrought in to run a leaderless council,
OL,8,Fafter councillors once again failed to
OL,9,Fform an administration.
OL,11,FMembers of Oldham Council held an
OL,12,Fextraordinary meeting on Thursday
OL,13,Fevening to resolve the stalemate of no
OL,14,Fpolitical party having an overall
OL,15,Fmajority.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
