OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil with no leader faces
OL,4,Agovernment takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's chief executive is now
OL,7,Fadvising the government of the
OL,8,Fsituation, which came about after
OL,9,FLabour lost eight seats and Reform UK
OL,10,Ftook seven in the elections in May,
OL,11,Fleaving no party with an overall
OL,12,Fmajority.
OL,14,FAn Oldham Council spokesperson said:
OL,15,F"As a result, the council's monitoring
OL,16,Fofficer will write to the Secretary of
OL,17,FState to formally advise of the
OL,18,Fsituation."
